# MagSafe Guard (sutz2001 fork)

**Canonical rules:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) — read for versioning, commits, README sync, upstream, and safety.

## Non-negotiable (always apply)

- **README:** update [README.md](../../README.md) + [README.de.md](../../README.de.md) together
- **Version:** edit [version.json](../../version.json) only → `task version:sync`; suggest bump before user-facing commits (see AGENTS.md)
- **Bundle ID:** `com.sutz2001.MagSafeGuard` — never `com.LekmanConsulting.*`
- **Commits:** English body with `## Summary` + `## Changes` — see [.github/instructions/commits.instructions.md](../../.github/instructions/commits.instructions.md)
- **No `Co-authored-by` trailers** — CI fails on `co-authored`, `claude`, `anthropic` anywhere in the message (including subject). Strip Cursor auto-trailers before push.

## Build

```bash
task setup && task build && task test
task version:show
```

## Security actions (only five)

`lockScreen`, `soundAlarm`, `forceLogout`, `shutdown`, `customScript`
